# Verifies: SPEC §13, §10 / D-MOD-04
# A doc test's scope is all declarations in the entry file plus same-directory modules
# (D-MOD-04). Confirms that even though entry_main.ybm itself does not declare double,
# a doc test block can directly call the double declared by the same-directory mod_helpers.ybm.

## Calls the double declared by mod_helpers.ybm from a doc test block (D-MOD-04).
##
## ```
## assert(double(21) == 42)
## ```
def describe_doubling(): str
    return "doubles n to 2n"

print(describe_doubling())
